rue','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(40,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Caves protected humans from animals. (True/False)','True','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(41,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Early humans used plastic tools. (True/False)','False','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(42,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Fire helped protect from wild animals. (True/False)','True','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(43,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Early humans stored food in refrigerators. (True/False)','False','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(44,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Seeds grow into plants. (True/False)','True','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(45,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Wheel helped in transport. (True/False)','True','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(46,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Early humans lived in ______.','caves','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(47,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Early humans led a ______ life.','nomadic','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(48,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Most early tools were made of ______.','stone','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(49,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Early humans were called hunters and ______.','gatherers','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(50,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Fire was discovered by rubbing two ______.','stones','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(51,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Fire helped humans cook ______.','meat','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(52,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Early humans covered their bodies with leaves and ______.','animal skin','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(53,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Growing crops is called ______.','farming','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(54,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','The invention of ______ helped carry heavy loads.','wheel','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(55,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Seeds grow into new ______.','plants','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(56,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','Early humans hunted animals for ______.','food','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(57,15,'SOCIAL STUDIES','General','The wheel helped in making ______.','pots','2026-01-04 08:30:31'),(58,15,'SOCIA